      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:3:3:63:6",
      "text": [
        " الزَّوْجُ أَحَقُّ بِامْرَأَتِهِ حَتَّى يَضَعَهَا فِي قَبْرِهَا ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Muhammad Bin Awrama, from Ali Bin Maysara, from Is’haq Bin Ammar, ",
          "from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The husband is more rightful with his wife until he places her in her grave’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "6. Sahl ibn Ziyad has narrated from Muhammad ibn ‘Uramah from Ali ibn Maysarah from Ishaq ibn ‘Ammar who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that a husband is more rightful to place his wife in the grave.” "
        ]
      }
